msgid "Grants the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Lost Steelsting</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to self or target ally.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Lost Steelsting Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>All attacks deal physical damage. However, all bonuses to damage dealt are determined by the attack's base damage type.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>300s<br>Effect cannot be stacked with </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Lost Spellforge</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
