msgid "Creates a barrier around self or party member that reflects most magic attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>10s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Spirit of the Guardian Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Duration is increased to 30s"
